<title>THAILAND: Thai Military Bank 1996 net up 18 pct.</title>
<headline>Thai Military Bank 1996 net up 18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 9.58	 vs	  8.72</p>
<p>    Net		    4,918.99	 vs    4,156.71</p>
<p>Notes: Fourth quarter figures not available. Thai Military Bank Plc is one of Thailand's major commercial banks.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
